    "Everything Archive writes, plus the two things Calibre cannot read: each shelf becomes a tag like “Shelf/Fiction/Sci-Fi”, and a book that has been read gets the tag “Read”. That is a mapping, not the real fields — Shelf's own are still written beside them and Calibre still ignores those.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alles, was „Archiv“ schreibt, dazu die zwei Dinge, die Calibre nicht lesen kann: Jedes Regal wird zu einem Tag wie „Shelf/Fiction/Sci-Fi“, und ein gelesenes Buch bekommt den Tag „Read“. Das ist eine Abbildung und nicht das echte Feld – Shelfs eigene Felder werden daneben weiter geschrieben, und Calibre ignoriert sie weiterhin."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Everything Archive writes, plus the two things Calibre cannot read: each shelf becomes a tag like “Shelf/Fiction/Sci-Fi”, and a book that has been read gets the tag “Read”. That is a mapping, not the real fields — Shelf's own are still written beside them and Calibre still ignores those."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything: the book files, the covers and a metadata.opf each. This can be imported back into Shelf with nothing lost.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alles: die Buchdateien, die Cover und je eine metadata.opf. Das lässt sich verlustfrei wieder in Shelf importieren."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Everything: the book files, the covers and a metadata.opf each. This can be imported back into Shelf with nothing lost."
          }
        }
      }
    },
