    "These would be added to the tags the book has. Nothing is taken off it — and nothing is ticked for you: a catalogue's subjects are not your vocabulary": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese kämen zu den Schlagwörtern des Buches hinzu. Es wird keines entfernt — und nichts ist für Sie angehakt: die Schlagwörter eines Katalogs sind nicht Ihre"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These would be added to the tags the book has. Nothing is taken off it — and nothing is ticked for you: a catalogue's subjects are not your vocabulary"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They all become": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
