    "They are usually what an import that was interrupted left behind. Nothing has been changed, and nothing will be until you say so.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Meist stammen sie aus einem unterbrochenen Import. Es wurde nichts geändert, und es wird nichts geändert, bevor Sie es sagen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "They are usually what an import that was interrupted left behind. Nothing has been changed, and nothing will be until you say so."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They go to the Trash, not away: you can put any of them back from there.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sie kommen in den Papierkorb, nicht weg: von dort können Sie jeden wieder herausholen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "They go to the Trash, not away: you can put any of them back from there."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This EPUB file would not change.": {
